{"version":1,"name":"SAVE\\SAVGAMG.DAT","data":"","leads":[{"id":"council-commissions","title":"Council commissions","detail":"Rolf says to read the proclamations at City Hall and ask the clerk about commissions."},{"id":"phlan-training-schools","title":"Training in New Phlan","detail":"Rolf showed the party where adventurers train. Return to the training schools when a character is ready to advance."},{"id":"harbor-trade","title":"The sea lanes","detail":"Rolf says few ships risk the passage and the council wants to reopen it."},{"id":"proclamation-lxiv","title":"Proclamation LXIV","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lxxviii","title":"Proclamation LXXVIII","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-cix","title":"Proclamation CIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lix","title":"Proclamation LIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"passage-sokal","title":"Passage to Sokal Keep","detail":"The harbor master says you can reach the keep by boat."},{"id":"sokal-arrival","title":"Arrival at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party landed on Thorn Island."},{"id":"sokal-reeds","title":"Reeds by the keep gate","detail":"The party saw a mound of reeds west of the gates."},{"id":"sokal-parchment","title":"The parchment at Sokal Keep","detail":"The party found a damaged scroll on a dead elf outside the keep."},{"id":"sokal-patrol-passed","title":"Sokal Keep patrol","detail":"The undead patrol accepted the word and let the party pass."},{"id":"sokal-ferran","title":"Ferran Martinez","detail":"Ferran is bound to guard the keep and asks whether Phlan has been freed."},{"id":"sokal-ambush","title":"Sokal courtyard ambush","detail":"A large force of orcs and hobgoblins rushed the party through the courtyard door."},{"id":"sokal-courtyard-note","title":"Note from the courtyard","detail":"The party found a note on a fallen hobgoblin and copied it as journal entry 57."},{"id":"sokal-chapel","title":"Sokal Keep chapel","detail":"The party found the remains of two orcs in the doorway and a large altar against the south wall."},{"id":"sokal-pale-form","title":"The keep's pale figure","detail":"A pale figure appeared inside the keep. The party can try speaking to it."},{"id":"sokal-phlan-fall","title":"Ferran's account of Phlan's fall","detail":"Ferran said creatures empowered by a magical pool overran Phlan. He named Tyranthraxus, Edranka, and Torath as their leaders."},{"id":"sokal-mendor","title":"Mendor's lost histories","detail":"Ferran says Mendor gathered accounts of the powers that brought down Phlan. His library was overrun."},{"id":"sokal-armory","title":"Sokal Keep armory","detail":"Ferran says help lies beyond an illusory wall in the armory."},{"id":"sokal-departure","title":"Ferran's password","detail":"Ferran told the party to say SAMOSUD to his guards on the way out."},{"id":"journal-entry-57","title":"Journal entry 57","detail":"The party encountered a reference to entry 57 in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"sokal-return-pier","title":"Boat back from Thorn Island","detail":"The party found a boat returning to New Phlan at the south pier."},{"id":"commission-slums","title":"Clear the Slums - in progress","detail":"Keep clearing encounters in the Slums until the district is secure. 1 of 25 encounters cleared.","status":"accepted","clearedEncounters":1},{"id":"commission-sokal","title":"Clear Sokal Keep - turned in","detail":"The council acknowledged the result.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"commission-records","title":"Recover records of old Phlan - offered","detail":"Search the old city for historical records and bring worthwhile finds to the clerk.","status":"offered"},{"id":"commission-auction","title":"Investigate the auction - accepted","detail":"If you're still in New Phlan, ask the harbor master about passage toward Podal Plaza. Observe the auction, identify the weapon, and report to the clerk.","status":"accepted"},{"id":"nomad-camp-found","title":"The Nomad Camp","detail":"The party found a camp on the overland route and can choose Enter or Leave."},{"id":"harbor-routes-reopened","title":"The harbor routes are open","detail":"The harbor master offers passage east, west, back to Sokal Keep, and to the north side of the bay."},{"id":"phlan-return-ferry","title":"Return ferry to New Phlan","detail":"Choose Take Boat at the dock to return to the civilized part of Phlan."},{"id":"commission-bottle","title":"Recover the silver bottle - offered","detail":"Search the kobold settlement far to the east for the bottle and bring it back to the dragon.","status":"offered"}],"party":{"SAVE\\CHRDATG1.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATG1.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG1.SPC":"WgAA/wAIALw5YQAA/wAIAIg8GgAA/wAIAJI8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG2.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATG2.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG2.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAKo8YQAA/wAIAKs8GgAA/wAIAKw8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG3.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATG3.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG3.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAMQ8YQAA/wAIAMU8GgAA/wAIAMY8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG4.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATG4.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG4.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAN48YQAA/wAIAN88GgAA/wAIAOA8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG5.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATG5.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEAACwBAEsAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG5.SPC":"WgAA/wAIAPg8YQAA/wAIAPk8GgAA/wAIAPo8LwAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATG6.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATG6.ITM":"C0NoYWluIE1haWwgIE1haWwgICAgICAgICAgICA3NQAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADcAMDcAAAEA